{"story":{"publicId":"bc6e2a21-a35f-4fb5-bd3e-84734e57c3d2","title":"亚马逊欧洲站燃油及物流附加费上调至2%"},"revision":"f3f3b62f71","developments":[{"factId":"fc5buGKM2v34","title":"亚马逊欧洲站燃油及物流附加费上调至2%","occurredAt":"2026-11-01T16:00:00.000Z","reportCount":3,"representative":{"id":"zx1i3z931v0f7cgd3t4wr0dni","revision":2,"title":"亚马逊宣布 11 月起欧洲站物流附加费上调至 2%","originalTitle":"11月起，亚马逊欧洲站物流附加费将上调至2%","summary":"亚马逊宣布将欧洲多个市场的燃油及物流附加费从 1.5% 上调至 2%，FBA 订单自 11 月 2 日起生效，MCF 业务自 11 月 19 日起覆盖。新费率按配送费用计算，预计使欧洲站 FBA 卖家每件商品平均增加约 0.02 欧元成本，英国站约为 0.02 英镑。亚马逊已更新 Seller Central 中的多项经营工具以纳入新费用，并强调该附加费将根据后续市场情况持续评估。","reason":"原文给出了欧洲站物流附加费上调的生效日期、适用市场及平均成本增幅，卖家可据此核算利润。","source":{"id":"author-amz123-summer","name":"AMZ123 · SUMMER","kind":"web_list","firstParty":false,"iconUrl":"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp","iconSrcSet":"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp 96w"},"links":{"aihot":"/items/zx1i3z931v0f7cgd3t4wr0dni","original":"https://www.amz123.com/t/GWhlPvYF"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedPrecision":"calendar","calendarDate":"2026-10-20","discoveredAt":"2026-10-20T02:37:38.073Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-20T02:37:38.073Z","category":"policy","tags":["费用变更","FBA/物流","亚马逊"],"score":72,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"bc6e2a21-a35f-4fb5-bd3e-84734e57c3d2","title":"亚马逊欧洲站燃油及物流附加费上调至2%"},"x":null,"media":[{"kind":"image","url":"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5303ec716f4c025e.webp","fullUrl":"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5303ec716f4c025e.webp","srcSet":"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5303ec716f4c025e.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/5303ec716f4c025e.webp 720w","width":null,"height":null,"alt":null,"poster":null}],"byline":{"author":"Summer","platform":"AMZ123"}}}],"nextCursor":null}